## `shared-config/base.json`

```json
{
    "plugins": ["./biome-plugins/no-object-assign.grit"],
    "linter": {
        "enabled": true,
        "rules": {
            "recommended": true
        }
    }
}
```

## `shared-config/biome-plugins/no-object-assign.grit`

```grit
`$fn($args)` where {
    $fn <: `Object.assign`,
    register_diagnostic(
        span = $fn,
        message = "Prefer object spread instead of Object.assign()",
        severity = "warn"
    )
}
```

